lly insensitive writings just a mistake of the author alone?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27618,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","user":"ShadowcatX","date":".  Phrasing 04-29-2023, 01:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-28T22:19:29-07:00","id":1510033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510032#post1510032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What does that mean? Was it the artist who released the preview? If not then it sounds like this is just the company trying to avoid responsibility for art they used in their books.<br /> <br /> Also, in the past were the culturally insensitive writings just a mistake of the author alone?</div> </div> </div> </div>I meant that it seems the artist made the illustrillustration and didn't tell the company he traced the picture of a real person. the wod brand team is very worried with cultural sensitivity,they just made a mistake out of ignorance,it happens with the best of us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 04-29-2023, 01:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-28T22:27:21-07:00","id":1510034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510026#post1510026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just checked. It was a mistake of the artist alone,</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really. That's why they have an art-director. That person is there to supervise stuff like this. It actually is ultimately their responsibility, not the artist's. The artist merely delivered their work. And then for this drawing to have ended up in the place where it did, it would have needed to have gone past several other pairs of eyes in the process. Also, there was a sensitivity reader that was supposed to check the book before release to the public (that was the claim in October last year at least). But given their rush to get this book out for Gen Con this year, who knows how much time they gave that person...<br /> <br /> Like, if you had a freelance-writer write a section and there's some problem with it, you can't just point at that writer and make them solely responsible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-28T22:30:01-07:00","id":1510035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510034#post1510034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not really. That's why they have an art-director. That person is there to supervise stuff like this. It actually is ultimately their responsibility, not the artist's. The artist merely delivered their work. And then for this drawing to have ended up in the place where it did, it would have needed to have gone past several other pairs of eyes in the process. Also, there was a sensitivity reader that was supposed to check the book before release to the public (that was the claim in October last year at least). But given their rush to get this book out for Gen Con this year, who knows how much time they gave that person...<br /> <br /> Like, if you had a freelance-writer write a section and there's some problem with it, you can't just point at that writer and make them solely responsible.</div> </div> </div> </div>they do have sensitivity readers,but since none of the werewolves in the book AFAIK are Maori,maybe their readers were from other groups. let me reiterate,it was ignorance,not malice or lack of caring.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-28T22:38:08-07:00","id":1510036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510035#post1510035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> they do have sensitivity readers,but since none of the werewolves in the book AFAIK are Maori,maybe their readers were from other groups. let me reiterate,it was ignorance,not malice or lack of caring.</div> </div> </div> </div>What you have just described <i>is </i>a sign of carelessness. Of course, given the way werewolves in W5 are described, indigenous people activists are still described as potential types of people who are Garou. But given the history of WtA, one thing they really wanted to avoid was any mistake in that area (that's why they changed the names of the Tribes, erased the links to human ethnicity/culture etc.). So it should've been reasonable to be <i>really </i>careful with anything in connection to that. Yeah, it's challenging to really spot every mistake in that area but given that with the W5-changes they went from writing about specific indigenous cultures to indigenous cultures, in general, all over the world, spotting stuff like what happened in this case gets even harder. But that's what they've signed up for here.<br /> <br /> For the WOD-team to blunder their way into putting this image in the book is a sign of carelessness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-28T22:39:11-07:00","id":1510037,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510036#post1510036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What you have just described <i>is </i>a sign of carelessness. Of course, given the way werewolves in W5 are described, indigenous people activists are still described as potential types of people who are Garou. But given the history of WtA, one thing they really wanted to avoid was any mistake in that area (that's why they changed the names of the Tribes, erased the links to human ethnicity/culture etc.). So it should've been reasonable to be <i>really </i>careful with anything in connection to that. Yeah, it's challenging to really spot every mistake in that area but given that with the W5-changes they went from writing about specific indigenous cultures to indigenous cultures, in general, all over the world, spotting stuff like what happened in this case gets even harder. But that's what they've signed up for here.<br /> <br /> For the WOD-team to blunder their way into putting this image in the book is a sign of carelessness.</div> </div> </div> </div>yeah,they really tried. and a mistake did ended up happening,but they'll fix it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-28T22:50:29-07:00","id":1510038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510037#post1510037\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> yeah,they really tried. and a mistake did ended up happening,but they'll fix it.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's the mistake the community noticed because it was being previewed, mind you. Now you gotta wonder: What about the rest of the book? What if they used the likeness of T\u00e4me in other places in the book? Are there images of Garou with tattoos that you would assume are Garou-tattoos where the artist actually just carelessly redrew sacred Maori-tattoos? Who knows... One of the points of all the changes of W5 was to not be shown to misunderstand or be ignorant of stuff like this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-28T22:53:02-07:00","id":1510039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510035#post1510035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> they do have sensitivity readers,but since none of the werewolves in the book AFAIK are Maori,maybe their readers were from other groups. let me reiterate,it was ignorance,not malice or lack of caring.</div> </div> </div> </div>If it wasnt lack of caring why didn't they have someone whose job it was to make sure this kind of thing didn't happen? If they do have that person how is this &quot;a mistake of the artist alone&quot;? <br /> <br /> What are the policies in place to prevent this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-28T23:50:33-07:00","id":1510043,"title":"","content":"If I am being honest, no art director can know every single piece of photography or art. As such, things slip in. Let's remember that Hunter the Vigil has a MUCH more blatant trace of Dante from Devil May Cry 3. It is good the community caught the theft before it went to print (I hope.)<br /> <br /> Given the preview was so small, I legit did not realise the character HAD Moko.<br /> <br /> I do not blame Renegade for this, because sadly corners being cut and Google images being used are nothing new in the art world. Often, it sadly falls to people connected to the subject to notice things like that. What matters is the willingness of the company to fix things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T00:32:33-07:00","id":1510045,"title":"","content":"This seems to re-emforce my concerns about development.<br /> <br /> Most of my takes have already been stated but I will comment I'm a little disappointed the art is mimicking the v5 thing of four generic guys in 20's fashion. Which does no favours in conveying what a tribe is about as a visual and is frankly rather bland.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T01:11:30-07:00","id":1510047,"title":"","content":"Parawolf has to bear at least some of the responsibility, if only because they've made a deal out of avoiding this stuff. OTOH if they can replace it before the book goes to print (which seems really unlikely) and there's nothing else on this level they'll have mostly made up for it.<br /> <br /> At least, that's my view with no ties to the culture in question. Maybe it's even worse than I'm presuming.<br /> <br /> <br /> Part of me is thinking back to H5's own problematic image. At least that one was apparently an interesting character concept if you knew what all the cultural signifiers meant, but it's still not great to have what looks like an outsider throwing cultural signifiers in without any care.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":4507,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","user":"TwoDSix","date":". 04-29-2023, 04:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T01:49:39-07:00","id":1510048,"title":"","content":"I don't know. It seems pretty simple to have the two following rules to make sure these things don't happen:<br /> <br /> 1) If the art director requests a minority subject in a piece from an artist, the art-director should be working with the sensitivity readers to make sure they don't stumble into anything.<br /> 2) If the artist decides to make an image of a minority subject of their own accord, they should be required to inform the art-director of this so the art-director knows to take a close look at that piece and potentially automatically send it to the sensitivity readers.<br /> <br /> It doesn't seem that hard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T02:56:12-07:00","id":1510049,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510048#post1510048\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know. It seems pretty simple to have the two following rules to make sure these things don't happen:<br /> <br /> 1) If the art director requests a minority subject in a piece from an artist, the art-director should be working with the sensitivity readers to make sure they don't stumble into anything.<br /> 2) If the artist decides to make an image of a minority subject of their own accord, they should be required to inform the art-director of this so the art-director knows to take a close look at that piece and potentially automatically send it to the sensitivity readers.<br /> <br /> It doesn't seem that hard.</div> </div> </div> </div>I suspect it also could have been avoided by doing your own art rather than picking some random pick of a guy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T03:08:18-07:00","id":1510050,"title":"","content":"To an extent. The Jewish coded hunter seemed to be a fully original work but was still... iffy.<br /> <br /> As well some Maori don't want outsiders drawing Maori with their moko at all, even if a completely original image; as the art form itself is sacred, an original work is still insensitive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T03:32:20-07:00","id":1510051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510050#post1510050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As well some Maori don't want outsiders drawing Maori with their moko at all, even if a completely original image; as the art form itself is sacred, an original work is still insensitive.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Possibly, but a general non white with facial tattoo is genrally more acceptable even if you argue its Maori. Although without clarification of artists intent it's hard to pin down what this glass walker pic represents is the figure even Maori?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T03:32:33-07:00","id":1510052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510050#post1510050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To an extent. The Jewish coded hunter seemed to be a fully original work but was still... iffy.<br /> <br /> As well some Maori don't want outsiders drawing Maori with their moko at all, even if a completely original image; as the art form itself is sacred, an original work is still insensitive.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1463822-hunter-the-reckoning-done-with-development?p=1483651#post1483651\">I loved your contextual analysis of that character.</a> As for the use of an actual person and their moko, I find it ironic that after tossing out the cultural and ethnic stuff for insensitivity, they do this in their first preview.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T03:59:17-07:00","id":1510054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510050#post1510050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To an extent. The Jewish coded hunter seemed to be a fully original work but was still... iffy.<br /> <br /> As well some Maori don't want outsiders drawing Maori with their moko at all, even if a completely original image; as the art form itself is sacred, an original work is still insensitive.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which begs the question; Why didn't they contact any sensitivity groups to CHECK these pieces of art?<br /> <br /> Like with CB20, I get the feeling the artists were given pretty free hands with the art and prompts. And the artists, I'm sad to say, went where the fence was lowest. No doubt because H5 and W5 were not their only work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T04:33:56-07:00","id":1510056,"title":"","content":"Interestingly on r/WhiteWolfRPG they seem to be removing mentions of the topic as &quot;internet conjecuture&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T04:41:44-07:00","id":1510058,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510043#post1510043\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I am being honest, no art director can know every single piece of photography or art. As such, things slip in. Let's remember that Hunter the Vigil has a MUCH more blatant trace of Dante from Devil May Cry 3.</div> </div> </div> </div>1) Wether they know everything or not it is still on them. <br /> <br /> 2) You're literally doing a &quot;what about ism&quot;. Those are bad and you shouldn't do it. <br /> <br /> 3) Are you aware that Dante is actually not a real person and the situations are nothing alike?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T04:48:06-07:00","id":1510059,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510056#post1510056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interestingly on r/WhiteWolfRPG they seem to be removing mentions of the topic as &quot;internet conjecuture&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>I started a thread on the topic and it was locked and deleted as an out of character falsehood. I wonder if they are standing to gain from W5 somehow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T04:53:05-07:00","id":1510060,"title":"","content":"These things do happen, but it's probably a good idea to add something into the briefs they give to artists about not tracing or plagiarising art (which they may already have), as well as something about taking extra care with representations of ethnic minorities and marginalised people (which they also may have), and then giving people the time to do it right (as well as allowing proper time for an approvals process). If I had to guess, it's probably that last part that's the stumbling block, not the first two.<br /> Rushing things for GenCon, for example, seems to be a particular problem in the RPG industry. Nearly everyone seems to do it, and it nearly always results in more mistakes than in those RPGs which weren't rushed out for GenCon.<br /> <br /> In the case of plagiarism, copying something from Devil May Cry, for example, is bad and may cost you money and/or street cred, but it will be a lesser ethical problem than representing real life people and cultures.<br /> <br /> ETA: Re-read my last paragraph if you think this is giving anyone a pass. It absolutely isn't. In fact, it's quite the opposite.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 05-01-2023, 11:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T04:56:38-07:00","id":1510061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510059#post1510059\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I started a thread on the topic and it was locked and deleted as an out of character falsehood. I wonder if they are standing to gain from W5 somehow.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've noted since the new mod team came in they tend to instantly delete anything that reflects badly on Paradox from the drama about treatment of Latinx folks, to certain public figures links to abusers, former cultural and gender/sexuality missteps and more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26564-badfurryfanfic","name":"BadFurryFanFic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T04:58:14-07:00","id":1510062,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510060#post1510060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These things do happen, but it's probably a good idea to add something into the briefs they give to artists about not tracing or plagiarising art (which they may already have), as well as something about taking extra care with representations of ethnic minorities and marginalised people (which they also may have), and then giving people the time to do it right (as well as allowing proper time for an approvals process). If I had to guess, it's probably that last part that's the stumbling block, not the first two.<br /> Rushing things for GenCon, for example, seems to be a particular problem in the RPG industry. Nearly everyone seems to do it, and it nearly always results in more mistakes than in those RPGs which weren't rushed out for GenCon.<br /> <br /> In the case of plagiarism, copying something from Devil May Cry, for example, is bad and may cost you money and/or street cred, but it will be a lesser ethical problem than representing real life people and cultures.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Everyone does it&quot; stopped being an okay answer back in high school. If you know of other companies who do things like this, I would suggest holding them accountable rather than giving them a pass because &quot;everyone does it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T05:34:07-07:00","id":1510065,"title":"","content":"No system can be perfect, let's just hope that another exciting pass catches everything and that it's in time for the first print run.<br /> <br /> Of course crunching a book out (which seems to have happened with W5) isn't going to help. Hopefully this will lead to books taking a little bit longer so things can be done right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T05:42:48-07:00","id":1510066,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510062#post1510062\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;Everyone does it&quot; stopped being an okay answer back in high school. If you know of other companies who do things like this, I would suggest holding them accountable rather than giving them a pass because &quot;everyone does it.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>They are working to fix it. It was an honest mistake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T06:01:29-07:00","id":1510067,"title":"","content":"The problem is that they certainly raised the stakes for themselves by lampshading the failings of previous WtA-editions. Under these conditions, even a small mistake weighs more heavily and therefore you'd expect them to be extra careful in this regard. Rushing things and cutting corners to meet the Gen-Con-release-date is a <i>really bad idea</i>. It doesn't just make them look bad but also makes them look like hypocrites.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T06:04:41-07:00","id":1510068,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510067#post1510067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The problem is that they certainly raised the stakes for themselves by lampshading the failings of previous WtA-editions. Under these conditions, even a small mistake weighs more heavily and therefore you'd expect them to be extra careful in this regard. Rushing things and cutting corners to meet the Gen-Con-release-date is a <i>really bad idea</i>. It doesn't just make them look bad but also makes them look like hypocrites.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe they'll delay it,give the book another pass. I can tell you this with absolutely certainty though. The worrying about removing wta pas t offensive aspects is important to them on a commercial and a personal level. I spoke with the writing team,all of them deeply care about not hurting anyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T06:16:09-07:00","id":1510069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510067#post1510067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The problem is that they certainly raised the stakes for themselves by lampshading the failings of previous WtA-editions. Under these conditions, even a small mistake weighs more heavily and therefore you'd expect them to be extra careful in this regard. Rushing things and cutting corners to meet the Gen-Con-release-date is a <i>really bad idea</i>. It doesn't just make them look bad but also makes them look like hypocrites.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much yeah, it's pretty likely nobody would give much of a damn about the name fianna without the get, wendigo and uktena changes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T06:25:08-07:00","id":1510070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510068#post1510068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Maybe they'll delay it,give the book another pass. I can tell you this with absolutely certainty though. The worrying about removing wta pas t offensive aspects is important to them on a commercial and a personal level.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that the commercial goals and the logistics machine will be hard to stop right now. After all if the book is supposed to be in USA for Gencon it's deep in print right now in China. They can do patches to the book and have specific pages reprinted before binding. All of that will delay the proofs and approvals. If they are serious about it they neee to do a proper check through the whole book delaying things even further.<br /> <br /> Really curious what happens next.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510068#post1510068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I spoke with the writing team,all of them deeply care about not hurting anyone.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> Except for Legacy fans. Their game is horrible and they should be ashamed of it anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T06:35:15-07:00","id":1510071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510066#post1510066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They are working to fix it. It was an honest mistake.</div> </div> </div> </div>Have they said as much in an official statement? All I've seen is &quot;it's the artist's fault.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T06:37:00-07:00","id":1510072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510068#post1510068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Maybe they'll delay it,give the book another pass. I can tell you this with absolutely certainty though. The worrying about removing wta pas t offensive aspects is important to them on a commercial and a personal level. I spoke with the writing team,all of them deeply care about not hurting anyone.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just not enough to check their artwork first apparently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T06:37:37-07:00","id":1510073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510068#post1510068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Maybe they'll delay it,give the book another pass. I can tell you this with absolutely certainty though. The worrying about removing wta pas t offensive aspects is important to them on a commercial and a personal level. I spoke with the writing team,all of them deeply care about not hurting anyone.</div> </div> </div> </div>You'd hope so. But we all know how higher-ups at companies can be when it comes to pushing developers to meet certain release-dates.<br /> <br /> I don't think Paradox would be very happy about the book getting delayed. And Renegade would certainly be angry as well. Setting up the printing and distribution as publisher certainly isn't something they do willy-nilly at a moment's notice whenever the WOD-team feels comfortable enough with the book to give it to Renegade. Plus Renegade has the book already up for pre-order on their website and told customers about the Gen-Con-release-date. I don't think they would love the idea of having to tell their customers about a delay for that reason either. The WOD-team has to fix this <i>super-fast</i> and if there's a delay they will need to offer a very good reason to Renegade and Paradox. I don't think a cautious &quot;Just to be sure...&quot; will suffice to convince them.<br /> <br /> Of course, the sad truth is that after rushing this through without a careful re-review to be absolutely sure no more mistakes were made and then the book gets released but there are still mistakes in the book... It's gonna be the WOD-team who will get thrown under the bus here. They will be the ones held responsible for the mistakes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T06:43:01-07:00","id":1510075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510073#post1510073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's gonna be the WOD-team who will get thrown under the bus here. They will be the ones held responsible for the mistakes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Being held accountable for your mistakes is not being thrown under the bus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T06:46:36-07:00","id":1510077,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510075#post1510075\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Being held accountable for your mistakes is not being thrown under the bus.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, I mean in the context of the WOD-team saying they would like a delay to make sure no more mistakes were made, then are told no because the Gen-Con-release-date is set in stone. Then the book gets released with mistakes after which the WOD-team gets blamed for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T06:48:48-07:00","id":1510078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510075#post1510075\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Being held accountable for your mistakes is not being thrown under the bus.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thing is. The writers and the artists are supposed to have oversight and approval if they are producing something for their parent company. They could have made an honest mistake or got shafted by an unconcious artist. (Remember the e3 incident and how Onyx moved switfly to rectify it).<br /> <br /> Renegade and Paradox are the ones in charge of the process and approvals. It had to go through multiple sets of eyes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T07:31:16-07:00","id":1510082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510058#post1510058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1) Wether they know everything or not it is still on them.<br /> <br /> 2) You're literally doing a &quot;what about ism&quot;. Those are bad and you shouldn't do it.<br /> <br /> 3) Are you aware that Dante is actually not a real person and the situations are nothing alike?</div> </div> </div> </div>It is still on them. What I meant is that, like with the Dante picture, the artist in this went for an easy solution and not a well-thought-out one at that. I meant no insult and I apologise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T08:12:40-07:00","id":1510084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510070#post1510070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200b<br /> <br /> Except for Legacy fans. Their game is horrible and they should be ashamed of it anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>Never, ever was anything like this stated about legacy Wod games, by any Wod5 developer, in the Wod5 development cycle. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T08:42:50-07:00","id":1510086,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510054#post1510054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Which begs the question; Why didn't they contact any sensitivity groups to CHECK these pieces of art?<br /> <br /> Like with CB20, I get the feeling the artists were given pretty free hands with the art and prompts. And the artists, I'm sad to say, went where the fence was lowest. No doubt because H5 and W5 were not their only work.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because mostly they not give a dawn about that, the problem is this result in legal issues, also these groups can just ignore then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T08:53:05-07:00","id":1510088,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510084#post1510084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Never, ever was anything like this stated about legacy Wod games, by any Wod5 developer, in the Wod5 development cycle.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Developer? No....well, not while he was Developer....before that? Plenty of times.<br /> <br /> But there are a number of current Community Managers and spokespeople on the official Discords that have said such a number of times.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T08:58:22-07:00","id":1510089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510088#post1510088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Developer? No....well, not while he was Developer....before that? Plenty of times.<br /> <br /> But there are a number of current Community Managers and spokespeople on the official Discords that have said such a number of times.</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean, like ... 25 years ago? Like, a whole professional and personal life ago? I surely do not have the same opinions about things, and the same way of relating to others, that I had in 1998. I suppose this is true for legacy fans and for Justin too.<br /> <br /> No Community Managers and spokespeople said anything similar: at worst, they said that if you wanted legacy-style games, you had legacy editions to play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T09:08:27-07:00","id":1510090,"title":"","content":"I dunno I've read stuff on the Discord that qualifies.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26564-badfurryfanfic","name":"BadFurryFanFic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T09:18:44-07:00","id":1510094,"title":"","content":"Based on conversations with a number of Freelancers who worked on various iterations of W5 I stand by the statement because nothing had changed according to them. I've personally witnessed spokespeople intimate that legacy fans are Fash sympathisers. If you don't believe me, fine. But its true.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T09:20:18-07:00","id":1510095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510086#post1510086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because mostly they not give a dawn about that, the problem is this result in legal issues, also these groups can just ignore then.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well I'm not THAT cynical. But I do think the artist did not care much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T09:27:38-07:00","id":1510097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510095#post1510095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well I'm not THAT cynical. But I do think the artist did not care much.</div> </div> </div> </div>Doesn't seem like anyone cares until they get caught, and once that happens it's shit rolls downhill.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T09:48:08-07:00","id":1510099,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510097#post1510097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Doesn't seem like anyone cares until they get caught, and once that happens it's shit rolls downhill.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can I ask,why are you so sure the whole thing wasn't an accident born out of ignorance?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T09:58:30-07:00","id":1510101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510099#post1510099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Can I ask,why are you so sure the whole thing wasn't an accident born out of ignorance?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because it's 2023. Because this is a company, presumably with an art director whose job is to make sure this shit doesn't happen. Because they made a huge point of rewriting everything in order to not have this kind of thing happen, alienating a lot of fans as they did it, only to have this happen on the first preview. Because the company hasn't came out, admitted wrong doing, and said how they're working to correct this problem and prevent it from happening again. Because this isn't their first rodeo. Do I need to go on?<br /> <br /> Why are you so eager to see them get a free pass?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T10:05:12-07:00","id":1510103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510101#post1510101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because it's 2023. Because this is a company, presumably with an art director whose job is to make sure this shit doesn't happen. Because they made a huge point of rewriting everything in order to not have this kind of thing happen, alienating a lot of fans as they did it, only to have this happen on the first preview. Because the company hasn't came out, admitted wrong doing, and said how they're working to correct this problem and prevent it from happening again. Because this isn't their first rodeo. Do I need to go on?<br /> <br /> Why are you so eager to see them get a free pass?</div> </div> </div> </div>Theu will fix it soon enough, they will correct it. They will pologize and we will be able to move on. I'm not giving anyone a free pass, I'm saying it was a honest mistake,I'm not absolving anyone. I want them to apologize and they will,I want them to fix it and they will. They have told me<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 04-29-2023, 01:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T10:22:19-07:00","id":1510106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510095#post1510095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well I'm not THAT cynical. But I do think the artist did not care much.</div> </div> </div> </div>What I meant is that this is not something that involves the artist directly so he doesn't have an opinion on the subject, that is, if you want to paint your face or not that's fine, he doesn't care, just be happy, but he won't bother to research it in depth to see if it has any meaning, let alone a company, this applies to most people on a series of subjects that are not of interest to them, at best they researched superficially on some site and they didn't even check the origin. The same goes for these sensive groups, they don't care about WoD, for them it's just a bunch of people playing as monsters, at best, I've seen some things that I won't even comment on to not trigger anyone, they don't care, so they leave it alone, it only becomes a problem when it goes against their ideals, and I assume you know what it becomes after that, so is a very complicated situation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T10:22:58-07:00","id":1510107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510103#post1510103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Theu will fix it soon enough, they will correct it. They will pologize and we will be able to move on. I'm not giving anyone a free pass, I'm saying it was a honest mistake,I'm not absolving anyone. I want them to apologize and they will,I want them to fix it and they will. They have told me</div> </div> </div> </div>Of course they will. And the more a project get complex, the more mistakes can happen: &quot;Second Inquisition&quot; was sensitivity-checked by a noted professional who does a lot of social commentary on asian representation in RPGs, and still there was the problem with Candomble and BOPES. Sensitivity readers cannot be expert about every possible cultural issues worldwide, and art direction on a corebook is a daunting task.<br /> <br /> These are not the kind of mistakes which are meant to actively harm someone: we should not think art directors, sensitivity readers, game designers and companies are all-knowing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T10:26:53-07:00","id":1510108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510107#post1510107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Of course they will. And the more a project get complex, the more mistakes can happen: &quot;Second Inquisition&quot; was sensitivity-checked by a noted professional who does a lot of social commentary on asian representation in RPGs, and still there was the problem with Candomble and BOPES. Sensitivity readers cannot be expert about every possible cultural issues worldwide, and art direction on a corebook is a daunting task.<br /> <br /> These are not the kind of mistakes which are meant to actively harm someone: we should not think art directors, sensitivity readers, game designers and companies are all-knowing.</div> </div> </div> </div>You put it better than I did. I agree with you<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T10:37:03-07:00","id":1510110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510106#post1510106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What I meant is that this is not something that involves the artist directly so he doesn't have an opinion on the subject, that is, if you want to paint your face or not that's fine, he doesn't care, just be happy, but he won't bother to research it in depth to see if it has any meaning, let alone a company, this applies to most people on a series of subjects that are not of interest to them, at best they researched superficially on some site and they didn't even check the origin. The same goes for these sensive groups, they don't care about WoD, for them it's just a bunch of people playing as monsters, at best, I've seen some things that I won't even comment on to not trigger anyone, they don't care, so they leave it alone, it only becomes a problem when it goes against their ideals, and I assume you know what it becomes after that, so is a very complicated situation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fully agreed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T10:45:56-07:00","id":1510112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510107#post1510107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Of course they will. And the more a project get complex, the more mistakes can happen: &quot;Second Inquisition&quot; was sensitivity-checked by a noted professional who does a lot of social commentary on asian representation in RPGs, and still there was the problem with Candomble and BOPES. Sensitivity readers cannot be expert about every possible cultural issues worldwide, and art direction on a corebook is a daunting task.<br /> <br /> These are not the kind of mistakes which are meant to actively harm someone: we should not think art directors, sensitivity readers, game designers and companies are all-knowing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or you could say, they got very lucky people voted for Glass Walkers and this was caught before the book went to print. Imagine if we hadn't gotten this preview: The book would've been released, people would've noticed the mistake, then said activist could've gotten involved (which could still happen despite that they caught this now) and we had yet another WOD5E-book release tied to controversy. Honest mistake or not, this is bad, <i>really </i>bad. Intent doesn't really matter when the resulting mistake is this bad. They copied a real person's face without permission who is an indigenous activist for Maori who are particularly sensitive about depictions of their tattoos in fiction and games. So with this one mistake, you get: 1) Using a real person's face without permission, 2) using an indigenous person's face, 3) appropriating indigenous culture in an offensive way. Sure, honest mistake but if you want to show respect, either do it fully understanding what you do and the context of these indigenous cultures (either through research or consultation with experts) or... don't do it. This &quot;honest mistake&quot; is the result of not taking the subject-matter seriously and half-assing it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T10:51:46-07:00","id":1510113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510107#post1510107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Second Inquisition&quot; was sensitivity-checked by a noted professional who does a lot of social commentary on asian representation in RPGs, and still there was the problem with Candomble and BOPES.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean...of course. What noteworthy expertise is someone whose area of study is Asian representation going to bring to South American aspects of the setting. That would be like getting a noted expert in the Black American experience to read through and comment on depictions of Laotian experiences and setting material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T11:22:08-07:00","id":1510114,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510103#post1510103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They have told me</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you want a cookie? What they told you doesnt mean shit. What have they told the community as a whole? Hell, what have they told the victim?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T15:09:46-07:00","id":1510128,"title":"","content":"I think a big part of this is, is that it keeps happening. There's only so many times someone can step on your toe and just apologize before a simple apology and moving their foot off your toe is good enough. There is a nebulous point where the intent of the action of where to put their foot doesn't matter compared to their intent to keep stepping anywhere near you since they can't seem to do that without stepping on your toe.<br /> <br /> I feel sorry for Jason Carl, being the guy that gets sent to do the apology videos for stuff he's not directly responsible for, but how many times can I listen to him apologize and things not get better before I don't care?<br /> <br /> There's something broken here. Multiple changes in leadership, multiple changes in developers, and multiple changes in business partners have not stopped these things from happening. Sure, it's very likely that we're being extremely attentive and noticing things we might not in other books, but that's born of years of these mistakes happening creating a feedback loop.<br /> <br /> The WoD community needs more than going back and fixing mistakes (not that they shouldn't do that too), we need Paradox to figure out why mistakes like this keep happening, and what they can do to reduce-if-not-end it.<br /> <br /> Not only is this important to just making quality books that keep the WoD brand strong (even if I don't like WoD5e, I want the WoD brand name to be something people think positively of because I play other WoD games), it's important to what the community looks like. TDM, the people hat make Mythras, rather recently got into some Internet trouble because they did a book in their Mythic Earth series (low-fantasy takes on various real world eras and cultures) on Polynesia... which got a bunch of Maori really pissed off at how the book treated things. The TDM forums has a bunch of people on it bragging about how they bought the book just to stick it to indigenous people that didn't like how their culture was appropriated,and there's a lot of hostility towards any criticisms of the book (and TDM's &quot;we'll make an official statement about this soon...&quot; is still pending last I checked).<br /> <br /> That's an ugly thing to let fester in your community. Every honest mistake with a quick patch and an apology that doesn't actually lead to change in how things are handled, is an open wound those sorts of folks can use to get into the body of the community and try to infect it with posts about being proud to have the &quot;uncensored&quot; version of books, and so on. These sorts of patterns attract horrible people to your Internet spaces, and adds to the work of trying to create a healthy fan community.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T18:37:07-07:00","id":1510139,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510128#post1510128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think a big part of this is, is that it keeps happening. There's only so many times someone can step on your toe and just apologize before a simple apology and moving their foot off your toe is good enough. There is a nebulous point where the intent of the action of where to put their foot doesn't matter compared to their intent to keep stepping anywhere near you since they can't seem to do that without stepping on your toe.<br /> <br /> I feel sorry for Jason Carl, being the guy that gets sent to do the apology videos for stuff he's not directly responsible for, but how many times can I listen to him apologize and things not get better before I don't care?<br /> <br /> There's something broken here. Multiple changes in leadership, multiple changes in developers, and multiple changes in business partners have not stopped these things from happening. Sure, it's very likely that we're being extremely attentive and noticing things we might not in other books, but that's born of years of these mistakes happening creating a feedback loop.<br /> <br /> The WoD community needs more than going back and fixing mistakes (not that they shouldn't do that too), we need Paradox to figure out why mistakes like this keep happening, and what they can do to reduce-if-not-end it.<br /> <br /> Not only is this important to just making quality books that keep the WoD brand strong (even if I don't like WoD5e, I want the WoD brand name to be something people think positively of because I play other WoD games), it's important to what the community looks like. TDM, the people hat make Mythras, rather recently got into some Internet trouble because they did a book in their Mythic Earth series (low-fantasy takes on various real world eras and cultures) on Polynesia... which got a bunch of Maori really pissed off at how the book treated things. The TDM forums has a bunch of people on it bragging about how they bought the book just to stick it to indigenous people that didn't like how their culture was appropriated,and there's a lot of hostility towards any criticisms of the book (and TDM's &quot;we'll make an official statement about this soon...&quot; is still pending last I checked).<br /> <br /> That's an ugly thing to let fester in your community. Every honest mistake with a quick patch and an apology that doesn't actually lead to change in how things are handled, is an open wound those sorts of folks can use to get into the body of the community and try to infect it with posts about being proud to have the &quot;uncensored&quot; version of books, and so on. These sorts of patterns attract horrible people to your Internet spaces, and adds to the work of trying to create a healthy fan community.</div> </div> </div> </div>i know i butt heads with you a lot but not this time. you are right,my only disagreement is that they happen maybe because people are rushing to meet deadlines. a great writer once ananlysed my writing and told me &quot;nicki,you make mistakes because you rush yourself&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T18:40:42-07:00","id":1510140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510114#post1510114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Do you want a cookie? What they told you doesnt mean shit. What have they told the community as a whole? Hell, what have they told the victim?</div> </div> </div> </div>there hasn't been enough time.<br /> edit: checked their tweeter,should have doen before. they have adressed it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 04-29-2023, 09:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T19:00:49-07:00","id":1510142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510140#post1510140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">there hasn't been enough time.<br /> edit: checked their tweeter,should have doen before. they have adressed it</div> </div> </div> </div>Can you provide a link?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-29T19:04:05-07:00","id":1510143,"title":"","content":"Sure thing<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/worldofdarkness/status/1652255583070765058?cxt=HHwWhIC2sdzs_u0tAAAA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1263750282531520512/6QkECdo9_400x400.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/worldofdarkness/status/1652255583070765058?cxt=HHwWhIC2sdzs_u0tAAAA\" target=\"_blank\"> World of Darkness (@worldofdarkness) on X </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/worldofdarkness/status/1652255583070765058?cxt=HHwWhIC2sdzs_u0tAAAA\" target=\"_blank\"> https://twitter.com/worldofdarkness/status/1652255583070765058?cxt=HHwWhIC2sdzs_u0tAAAA </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> We are now aware of the questions that have been raised around one of the illustrations in this preview, and we appreciate everyone who contacted us about it. We have reached out to the artist for details about the piece, and we will update the community as quickly as possible. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":