":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T14:29:48-07:00","id":1510255,"title":"","content":"i guess at this point i'll hit the &quot;let's agree to disagree &quot; button on the overall quality of writing. i genuinely am liking it but i'm on a mind that what is cool is very subjective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 04-30-2023, 05:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T14:34:07-07:00","id":1510256,"title":"","content":"what i'm gonna ask you for you guys to give the wod brand team is time, because they have to deal with a lot. and they have to do a lot to fix things. so they need time. please d'ont ask for immediate solutions,there simply isn't enought time.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T14:35:00-07:00","id":1510257,"title":"","content":"as for squadx. pretend i do not exist, ignore me completely i'll do the same with you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T14:38:04-07:00","id":1510260,"title":"","content":"I can only speak for myself, but they cut my good grace towards them in half when they labeled the key motivations and backstories of half the WTA stories I love as &quot;b r e e d i n g elements&quot;. I'm sure there are other people who are more patient and loving than I, but there's been quite a lot of thinly veiled insults towards what came before, so I have to admit to some schadenfreude when their new improved stuff goes awry; I'm not a saint!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T14:43:07-07:00","id":1510261,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510256#post1510256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what i'm gonna ask you for you guys to give the wod brand team is time, because they have to deal with a lot. and they have to do a lot to fix things. so they need time. please d'ont ask for immediate solutions,there simply isn't enought time.</div> </div> </div> </div>Time?! We're living in the age of the Internet! Time is the one thing they don't have! Considering how fast-moving online-discourse is, they need to get ahead of the narrative asap. You don't want to leave people with the idea of &quot;Real life Maori-activist copied without permission into a WOD-game while disrespecting Maori-culture&quot; for days!<br /> <br /> That's why this is carelessness. You're supposed to be careful in order to avoid scenarios like this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T14:44:45-07:00","id":1510263,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510260#post1510260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can only speak for myself, but they cut my good grace towards them in half when they labeled the key motivations and backstories of half the WTA stories I love as &quot;b r e e d i n g elements&quot;. I'm sure there are other people who are more patient and loving than I, but there's been quite a lot of thinly veiled insults towards what came before, so I have to admit to some schadenfreude when their new improved stuff goes awry; I'm not a saint!</div> </div> </div> </div>i can s\u00b4peak a little about that. you know that quote from mewtwo on the first pokemons &quot;\u201cI see now that the circumstances of one's birth are irrelevant. It is what you do with the gift of life that determines who you are.\u201d? i don't know if the wod brand team are pokemon fans,but they firmly believe in that quote. they firmly beleive things your are born with and your birth don't define you at all. not even a a little.So they removed the Garou-Born,for they were reviled for being born disable<br /> <br /> They removed the idea that certain backgrounds led to certain tribes,because that would indicate that your birth and not your life would decide your tribe<br /> <br /> everything that indicates that you can BE something from birth is a big no-no in the eyes of the wod brand team. you cannot be born as a warrior,sage,fighter or <i>anyhting </i>in their eyes. you only become sometthing through your life.<br /> \u200bi agree with this reiminagination,but again,it's subjective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 04-30-2023, 05:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T14:46:44-07:00","id":1510264,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510261#post1510261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Time?! We're living in the age of the Internet! Time is the one thing they don't have! Considering how fast-moving online-discourse is, they need to get ahead of the narrative asap. You don't want to leave people with the idea of &quot;Real life Maori-activist copied without permission into a WOD-game while disrespecting Maori-culture&quot; for days!<br /> <br /> That's why this is carelessness. You're supposed to be careful in order to avoid scenarios like this.</div> </div> </div> </div>i know,i'm asking you guys for time because i can talk to you guys. because i know you. i spoke with jason carl,he's working on it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T14:54:36-07:00","id":1510266,"title":"","content":"I'm talking about different kinds of stories when I reference the &quot;breeding elements&quot; thing - the removal of Kinfolk and Metis has fallout.<br /> <br /> The Black and Native American boy who grew up with an ultra-conservative Uktena grandmother who knew he would be Garou but never thought he was good enough, who drove him away from his own people with her impossible expectations for her blood.<br /> <br /> The Stargazer Theurge who grew up with a Lupus father visiting her and her sick mother once a month... once a year... once every two years... and as she gets older and older the visits get scarcer, until they stop entirely. He couldn't smell the wolf on her; she was Kinfolk. He probably had a lot of other kids to visit. And so she devoted every waking moment to saving Gaia as a Kinfolk. To getting her PhD in Environmental Conservation, to fighting for reintroduction of Wolves and Birds of Prey into environments where they dwelled historically, to- and then she has her belated First Change. And guess who is suddenly father of the year?<br /> <br /> The PB5 Fianna Galliard who grew up among the Mother's Fundamentalists, monstrous people who wanted perfection and only perfection. Only they were pure. Even other Fianna were failures. Bitter, hateful people, who tried to make them into the 'perfect son', a role they could never fulfil. And so they run away from their extensive tightknit Garou family to join a pack of outcasts their family would despise.<br /> <br /> The Metis Child of Gaia who was raised by Kinfolk. Who knows his parents left him to be raised by supportive and kind guardians, but will never know who they were or why they broke the Litany. For love? For lust? Because trauma brought them together?<br /> <br /> No more Metis. No more Kinfolk. Depending on how Kin and Werewolf Families are written it is plausible that you could streeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeetch to make some of these stories ghosts of their former selves in W5, if you really wanted to.<br /> <br /> And removing it is okay. Make a new game, the old one still exists. But you're not just removing content because you're not interested in developing it further. It gets the lovely little label of &quot;breeding elements&quot;, along with implications of being pro-eugenics.<br /> <br /> So yeah, ultimately when there are hiccups for W5 my initial response will probably boil down to &quot;lol. lmao.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T14:57:51-07:00","id":1510267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510266#post1510266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm talking about different kinds of stories when I reference the &quot;breeding elements&quot; thing - the removal of Kinfolk and Metis has fallout.<br /> <br /> The Black and Native American boy who grew up with an ultra-conservative Uktena grandmother who knew he would be Garou but never thought he was good enough, who drove him away from his own people with her impossible expectations for her blood.<br /> <br /> The Stargazer Theurge who grew up with a Lupus father visiting her and her sick mother once a month... once a year... once every two years... and as she gets older and older the visits get scarcer, until they stop entirely. He couldn't smell the wolf on her; she was Kinfolk. He probably had a lot of other kids to visit. And so she devoted every waking moment to saving Gaia as a Kinfolk. To getting her PhD in Environmental Conservation, to fighting for reintroduction of Wolves and Birds of Prey into environments where they dwelled historically, to- and then she has her belated First Change. And guess who is suddenly father of the year?<br /> <br /> The PB5 Fianna Galliard who grew up among the Mother's Fundamentalists, monstrous people who wanted perfection and only perfection. Only they were pure. Even other Fianna were failures. Bitter, hateful people, who tried to make them into the 'perfect son', a role they could never fulfil. And so they run away from their extensive tightknit Garou family to join a pack of outcasts their family would despise.<br /> <br /> The Metis Child of Gaia who was raised by Kinfolk. Who knows his parents left him to be raised by supportive and kind guardians, but will never know who they were or why they broke the Litany. For love? For lust? Because trauma brought them together?<br /> <br /> No more Metis. No more Kinfolk. Depending on how Kin and Werewolf Families are written it is plausible that you could streeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeetch to make some of these stories ghosts of their former selves in W5, if you really wanted to.<br /> <br /> And removing it is okay. Make a new game, the old one still exists. But you're not just removing content because you're not interested in developing it further. It gets the lovely little label of &quot;breeding elements&quot;, along with implications of being pro-eugenics.<br /> <br /> So yeah, ultimately when there are hiccups for W5 my initial response will probably boil down to &quot;lol. lmao.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>i undestand you,there's always something lost","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T15:00:24-07:00","id":1510268,"title":"","content":"I'm still salty about the Garou born being dropped. I could get behind making them more fertile, although not to a 'normal' level, but they hit a lot of potential angles that the others don't.<br /> <br /> As a metis you can be who you want to be, as long as you don't want to be a biologivcal parent (and even then the Glasswalkers probably have something up their sleeve by now). But the society you were born to looks down on you for being 'deformed', for having the wrong parents, and for being a living reminder that somebody broke the rules. You lose a lot of the nurture angle that lets people move beyond what they were born with, and instead get the identity others view as deserved forced upon them.<br /> <br /> Plus remember, no matter what he said Mewtwo was still a telepathic cat, not a water firing turetle. He can be who he wants to be and live his life how he wantsas long as what he wants isn't to be a squirtle. We all, like Mewtwo, must live with the fact that we aren't squirtles, but we can take the life we were dealt and choose the way we want to live it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T15:01:50-07:00","id":1510269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510264#post1510264\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> i know,i'm asking you guys for time because i can talk to you guys. because i know you. i spoke with jason carl,he's working on it</div> </div> </div> </div>And as far as PR is concerned, that's a bad message. Give him time to do... what? And how much time does he need? A day? A week? A month? This really just reinforces my idea that this one drawing just turned out to be the tip of the iceberg here...<br /> <br /> Of course, it's stressful for the WOD-team to deal with this now but this late in the game the calculus is &quot;Every second this bad stuff is out there is one second where somebody who had pre-ordered the book could see this and cancel their pre-order afterward.&quot;. That's why you're supposed to be careful beforehand! Once the public gets involved this all becomes more stressful...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T15:28:30-07:00","id":1510274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TwoDSix</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510268#post1510268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm still salty about the Garou born being dropped. I could get behind making them more fertile, although not to a 'normal' level, but they hit a lot of potential angles that the others don't.<br /> <br /> As a metis you can be who you want to be, as long as you don't want to be a biologivcal parent (and even then the Glasswalkers probably have something up their sleeve by now). But the society you were born to looks down on you for being 'deformed', for having the wrong parents, and for being a living reminder that somebody broke the rules. You lose a lot of the nurture angle that lets people move beyond what they were born with, and instead get the identity others view as deserved forced upon them.</div> </div> </div> </div>The reason why the Garou born were needed for the old game was to make unions between the Garou taboo and problematic in the most heavy handed way possible. They knew people were gonna ignore it (and boy they did!). However, the design decision for that was not to create a subgroup of broken people who need to do more to gain the same acceptance others do, it was there to ensure the Garou were bonded with humans and wolves and that they had to care for both those groups and understand both those groups to be good at what they do. This is why kinfolk are crucial to the game and why you cannot treat them as shit on principle (not that some won't, but that's on them). As a result, familial units grew into septs who grew into clans who grew into Tribes creating the huge sprawling tribes that we got in Werewolf.<br /> <br /> Without this requirement for the big bonded families, you don't get the Nation nor do you get Werewolves tied into human and wolf concerns. You get a hidden race of superior beings only consorting with their own and not bothering to actually understand what they need to fight for!<br /> <br /> Ironically, many problems of the nation come from them leaning way too much into their wolf or human natures instead of actually balancing the two. They also come from the fact that many tribes have put their own first over others. Yet now we don't have a Nation built through human concerns and like looking out for like, for now the totems are ultimate arbiters of membership and creed, rather then the cultures that brought up the Nation as a convention to stop killing each other over stupid shit.<br /> <br /> <br /> So when they tell me all that &quot;breeding stuff&quot; was horrible and wrong, the only conclusion I can have is that you either didn't read the books or missed the bloody point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T16:29:48-07:00","id":1510285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510274#post1510274\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The reason why the Garou born were needed for the old game was to make unions between the Garou taboo and problematic in the most heavy handed way possible. They knew people were gonna ignore it (and boy they did!). However, the design decision for that was not to create a subgroup of broken people who need to do more to gain the same acceptance others do, it was there to ensure the Garou were bonded with humans and wolves and that they had to care for both those groups and understand both those groups to be good at what they do. This is why kinfolk are crucial to the game and why you cannot treat them as shit on principle (not that some won't, but that's on them). As a result, familial units grew into septs who grew into clans who grew into Tribes creating the huge sprawling tribes that we got in Werewolf.<br /> <br /> Without this requirement for the big bonded families, you don't get the Nation nor do you get Werewolves tied into human and wolf concerns. You get a hidden race of superior beings only consorting with their own and not bothering to actually understand what they need to fight for!</div> </div> </div> </div>Alternately, the Nagah, though most children of Nagah/Nagah pairings are still going to be kinfolk, so they still end up having extensive kin families.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T16:34:25-07:00","id":1510286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510285#post1510285\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Alternately, the Nagah, though most children of Nagah/Nagah pairings are still going to be kinfolk, so they still end up having extensive kin families.</div> </div> </div> </div>For a group that makes Euthanatos seem warm and cuddly, Nagah sure have healthy and positive familial and communal relations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T17:27:14-07:00","id":1510294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510256#post1510256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what i'm gonna ask you for you guys to give the wod brand team is time, because they have to deal with a lot. and they have to do a lot to fix things. so they need time. please d'ont ask for immediate solutions,there simply isn't enought time.</div> </div> </div> </div>How much time does it take for them to take the image down from Renegades website, and their own social media stuff? A few minutes? If they recognize how big of a problem this is, they could do at least that. If they're not going to at least take the picture down for now, what does time really have to do with it?<br /> <br /> Also, if you're talking to them, perhaps remind them that the can make accounts here, or on RPG.net, and so on. They can communicate for themselves in spaces that aren't their private Discord servers. Regaining trust from fans they've upset should behoove them to come to us, not for us to come to them.<br /> <br /> Honestly, I get it, you want to go to bat for them because you're talking to them and see their perspective. But they're not talking to us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T17:37:22-07:00","id":1510296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510294#post1510294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How much time does it take for them to take the image down from Renegades website, and their own social media stuff? A few minutes? If they recognize how big of a problem this is, they could do at least that. If they're not going to at least take the picture down for now, what does time really have to do with it?<br /> <br /> Also, if you're talking to them, perhaps remind them that the can make accounts here, or on RPG.net, and so on. They can communicate for themselves in spaces that aren't their private Discord servers. Regaining trust from fans they've upset should behoove them to come to us, not for us to come to them.<br /> <br /> Honestly, I get it, you want to go to bat for them because you're talking to them and see their perspective. But they're not talking to us.</div> </div> </div> </div>once more we see eye to eye,heavy on that your're absolutely right","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T18:04:04-07:00","id":1510299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510256#post1510256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what i'm gonna ask you for you guys to give the wod brand team is time, because they have to deal with a lot. and they have to do a lot to fix things. so they need time. please d'ont ask for immediate solutions,there simply isn't enought time.</div> </div> </div> </div>How much time do good people need before they can do the right thing after they do something very wrong?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T00:01:23-07:00","id":1510326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510219#post1510219\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think they've done an exceptionally good job at being bland, boring, unfun and uninspired. It's as if someone was being paid for word count and had no actual passion for the project. Werewolf was always meant to be extreme, and Glass walkers were no exception to that. Where's my Wise Guy, my digital wolf, my green haired transhuman cyborg, my power-armoured furry rocking 20mm? None of that. We have a city planner who wants to ease traffic jams and add a few green spaces rather than pedestrianize the whole city. Why so moderate. It's very evident they don't care.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Bit puzzled as to how a Maori would end up a poster boy for a werewolf tribe when NZ has never had wolves, and why he'd have a vastly different tattoo style on his arm... Like, even if we ignore the copying bit, that's stupid.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> yeah the contreversy aside their a blandification of wod products across the board and it really shows in w5. As though the setting is fundemently insecure in its own premises. One of my main critiques of Forsaken back in the day was the forsaken tribes where quite bland and just felt like you just had two layers of auspice. This contrasted with the pure tribes who were quite colourful. But forsaken clearly had and has a lot of love for larger than life stuff I'm just not getting from w5.<br /> <br /> I thiiiiiink the moari is supposed to be a generic poc with face tats. Looking contextually at the other pics which are all just regular people in 20's clothing I'm not sure much thought went into them beyond aesthetic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T00:20:22-07:00","id":1510328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510263#post1510263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They removed the idea that certain backgrounds led to certain tribes,because that would indicate that your birth and not your life would decide your tribe<br /> <br /> everything that indicates that you can BE something from birth is a big no-no in the eyes of the wod brand team. you cannot be born as a warrior,sage,fighter or <i>anyhting </i>in their eyes. you only become sometthing through your life.<br /> \u200bi agree with this reiminagination,but again,it's subjective.</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel that part only applies if you look at the tribes at a surface level. While they are tribes that are exclusive, they are in the minority. A no purebreed male Caucasian homid can join these tribes; Bone Gnawers, Children of Gaia, Fianna, Get of Fenris, Glass Walkers, Silent Striders, Shadow Lords and Stargazers. They cannot join; Black Furies, Red Talons, Silver Fangs, Ghost Council and Galestalkers.<br /> <br /> But I'm not going to argue all the changes were bad, as this IS a reboot. What bothers me with W5 tribes so far, is the lack of werewolf in the text and the concepts being so mundane. It truly feels like the wanted playstyle for Walkers is either an office drone or a mildly criminal street thug. There is no sense that these characters could actually tear someone's throat out, you know?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T00:57:46-07:00","id":1510331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510326#post1510326\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I thiiiiiink the moari is supposed to be a generic poc with face tats. Looking contextually at the other pics which are all just regular people in 20's clothing I'm not sure much thought went into them beyond aesthetic.</div> </div> </div> </div>How much does it really matter if they can ID the person it was copied from?<br /> <br /> The whole concept of &quot;generic PoC with face tats&quot; is bad in the first place. Thinking of real groups of real people as concepts you can mush together into &quot;generic guy with face tats&quot; is the offensive kind of thinking that's made sensitivity readers and consultants necessary in the first place. It's caricature in the basest of wrong ways.<br /> <br /> You get that it's even more insulting to just see all non-white people as interchangeable, right? That if what you're speculating is true, it just reflects even worse on Paradox and Renegade, not better?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T01:09:34-07:00","id":1510332,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510331#post1510331\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How much does it really matter if they can ID the person it was copied from?<br /> <br /> The whole concept of &quot;generic PoC with face tats&quot; is bad in the first place. Thinking of real groups of real people as concepts you can mush together into &quot;generic guy with face tats&quot; is the offensive kind of thinking that's made sensitivity readers and consultants necessary in the first place. It's caricature in the basest of wrong ways.<br /> <br /> You get that it's even more insulting to just see all non-white people as interchangeable, right? That if what you're speculating is true, it just reflects even worse on Paradox and Renegade, not better?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Matter is a complex mindset, I'm interested in the steps which led to this so it matters to me. Pretty much everyone else has already gone through the blow by blow of how bad it is so I havnt really got much to say on that.<br /> <br /> I don't really have a problem with fictional characters having facial tattoos regardless of ethnicity-ones youve creates yourself and not some trace you got online of coarse. If the intent was explicitly the non white guy as the guy with tattoos that becomes a more complex issue depending on intent context and execution. This case being an obvious foul up.<br /> <br /> <br /> You're arguing with yourself here. I wasn't justifying the execution or intent i was speculating on mindset of the artists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 05-01-2023, 04:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T02:34:19-07:00","id":1510339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510255#post1510255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i guess at this point i'll hit the &quot;let's agree to disagree &quot; button on the overall quality of writing. i genuinely am liking it but i'm on a mind that what is cool is very subjective.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh they can certainly string a sentence together, I'd even say the writing skill is well above the average for a 5th edition product (not to mention some later 20th material). I think it's clear as day that they hired a professional, but while a professional might do their best to craft a good sentence I think there's a lacking care for the subject matter, though whether the blame goes to the writer or director I do not know.<br /> Case in point: while I object to the very idea that werewolves should be so attached to dayjobs, the cityplanner's apparent focus on more green spaces and better traffic flow is so five-minute-google that it's inclusion is clearly obligation rather than an idea with depth that merits consideration. More Green spaces and better traffic flow are almost universal goals that every city planner wants to achieve, there's no struggle there that warrants the interest of a werewolf; but the methods to obtain these things are contentious: better traffic flow could be obtained by widening the roads and adding new lanes, or it could be done by adding busses and bike lanes , or it could be done by removing cars entirely from certain areas and pedestrianizing the place: these are methods people would actually fight over, and are worth Werewolf consideration, especially in how they're likely to favour more extreme options.<br /> <br /> Something that could've been interesting ( excluding emergency vehicles, werewolves want to ban all cars from the inner city! Spicy!) has been written in the most boring way it could (werewolves hate traffic congestion! Bland!) We can also see a lack of care when it comes to the Maori, they don't give a fuck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T05:07:35-07:00","id":1510346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510332#post1510332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Matter is a complex mindset,</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a forum, you have time and word count to answer a complex question fully even if it was phrased simply instead of just dodging it by saying it's complicated.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'm interested in the steps which led to this so it matters to me. </div> </div> </div>As nobody here can actually answer that for you, it seems strange to speculate to with yourself in a place of discussion with other people.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I don't really have a problem with fictional characters having facial tattoos regardless of ethnicity-ones youve creates yourself and not some trace you got online of coarse. </div> </div> </div>Again though, that's how things like diversity consultants become a necessity. What you're personally comfortable with isn't really the standard things operate on. If you want to be respectful of Maori culture as an outsider, you shouldn't be drawing &quot;fictional&quot; versions of their tattoos too. Even if the intent wasn't to specifically do a Maori character with Maori tattoos, if you know so little about tattoo culture to end up doing that by accident... you probably should have been asking people that know more about this.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If the intent was explicitly the non white guy as the guy with tattoos that becomes a more complex issue depending on intent context and execution. This case being an obvious foul up.<br /> <br /> You're arguing with yourself here. I wasn't justifying the execution or intent i was speculating on mindset of the artists. </div> </div> </div>It isn't really that complicated though. I'm not trying t argue with myself, I'm trying to point out that you're over-complicating something. You're not going to be able to divine the mindset of the artist from speculating a dozen different possible ways this happened.<br /> <br /> And you might not intend it to be so, but yeah, your speculations are ones that lean towards justification of the screw up. You're only choosing the share the speculations that downplay the mistakes made.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T06:54:44-07:00","id":1510349,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510332#post1510332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're arguing with yourself here. I wasn't justifying the execution or intent i was speculating on mindset of the artists.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean the artist's mindset is pretty clear. The artist was lazy, got on Google, typed in &quot;Maori Tattoos&quot; and then largely copied one of the pictures that popped up. When I typed, &quot;Maori Tattoos&quot; into Google, the photograph that served as the source for the picture was one of the first 15 to pop up. Unfortunately the artist chose one of the worst people to choose to copy and modify an image from, since T\u0101me Iti has been litigious in the past when it comes to people using and modifying his likeness and tattoos without permission. It leaves me wondering how many other photographs the artist has copied previously - I'm guessing this wasn't their first rodeo.<br /> <br /> Regardless, White Wolf needs to get out in front of this ASAP because it's very plausible they're going to be looking at some sort of legal action, and even if it's just having to offer a public apology, and when it hits the RPG news sites that White Wolf was forced into it, it's just going to reinforce a lot of bad opinions that people have about White Wolf as a company - trying to be edgy, not respecting minorities, etc.<br /> <br /> They should have already released a statement saying that they're aware of what happened, that they are trying to get into contact with T\u0101me Iti, that they are cutting that artwork from the product and that they're going to sever ties with the artist. That's all stuff that's probably going to end up happening anyway, but the longer White Wolf waits the worse it will look for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T07:12:23-07:00","id":1510352,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510346#post1510346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a forum, you have time and word count to answer a complex question fully even if it was phrased simply instead of just dodging it by saying it's complicated.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> As nobody here can actually answer that for you, it seems strange to speculate to with yourself in a place of discussion with other people.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Again though, that's how things like diversity consultants become a necessity. What you're personally comfortable with isn't really the standard things operate on. If you want to be respectful of Maori culture as an outsider, you shouldn't be drawing &quot;fictional&quot; versions of their tattoos too. Even if the intent wasn't to specifically do a Maori character with Maori tattoos, if you know so little about tattoo culture to end up doing that by accident... you probably should have been asking people that know more about this.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> It isn't really that complicated though. I'm not trying t argue with myself, I'm trying to point out that you're over-complicating something. You're not going to be able to divine the mindset of the artist from speculating a dozen different possible ways this happened.<br /> <br /> And you might not intend it to be so, but yeah, your speculations are ones that lean towards justification of the screw up. You're only choosing the share the speculations that downplay the mistakes made.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nah its just a bad question and but i answered it anyway. I'm sorry you don't like my line of reasoning. My answer was &quot; I'm interested in it so yeah it does.&quot; What part do you need further elaboration on.<br /> <br /> i dont recall saying they did, I'm not even sure what your point is their.<br /> <br /> you're still arguing with yourself here.<br /> <br /> You definatly are. I think, it's actually rather hazy what you're objection is here.<br /> <br /> How would it be downplaying if the cause is laziness as I've speculated? The effect is the same regardless. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 05-01-2023, 10:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T07:18:40-07:00","id":1510354,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510349#post1510349\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean the artist's mindset is pretty clear. The artist was lazy, got on Google, typed in &quot;Maori Tattoos&quot; and then largely copied one of the pictures that popped up. When I typed, &quot;Maori Tattoos&quot; into Google, the photograph that served as the source for the picture was one of the first 15 to pop up. Unfortunately the artist chose one of the worst people to choose to copy and modify an image from, since T\u0101me Iti has been litigious in the past when it comes to people using and modifying his likeness and tattoos without permission. It leaves me wondering how many other photographs the artist has copied previously - I'm guessing this wasn't their first rodeo.<br /> <br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> pretty much yeah that's what I suspect. I figured it'd be a photo from a search engine or somesuch. The artist is certainly a bit of a hack if this sort of thing is occurring.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T07:36:49-07:00","id":1510355,"title":"","content":"Folks- first off, please allow me to stress that there is no White Wolf any more. Paradox owns what were the White Wolf game lines, and licenses them out to other companies. If you have issues with W5, then you are looking at Paradox and Renegade, depending on the specific issue. From out here, I'm afraid I can't tell you which entity or both may have been ADing the werewolf character in question.<br /> <br /> Second: we're going to need to have you all ease back the intensity of your posting, particularly in response to each other. Having our forum community attack and insult each other because of concerns with another company or companies' situation is not in the spirit of these Onyx Path forums. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T07:42:57-07:00","id":1510357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510355#post1510355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Folks- first off, please allow me to stress that there is no White Wolf any more. Paradox owns what were the White Wolf game lines, and licenses them out to other companies. If you have issues with W5, then you are looking at Paradox and Renegade, depending on the specific issue. From out here, I'm afraid I can't tell you which entity or both may have been ADing the werewolf character in question.<br /> <br /> Second: we're going to need to have you all ease back the intensity of your posting, particularly in response to each other. Having our forum community attack and insult each other because of concerns with another company or companies' situation is not in the spirit of these Onyx Path forums. Thanks!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks Rich.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T19:46:39-07:00","id":1510457,"title":"","content":"Edited: Doesn't really matter any more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-02T11:06:45-07:00","id":1510500,"title":"","content":"The tweet and the preview are gone from the Renegade site. <a href=\"https://twitter.com/worldofdarkness/status/1653459362742927364\" target=\"_blank\">Outstar just posted a formal response</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A piece of art in the Werewolf: The Apocalypse 5th Edition Core Rulebook contained an illustration that depicted the likeness of T\u0101me Wairere Iti, a key figure of the M\u0101ori protest movement, as a member of the Glass Walker tribe of the Garou. We apologize to Mr. Iti, and to the M\u0101ori community for any harm caused.<br /> <br /> We have taken action to remove the art from the digital PDF and physical copies of the book, which will be available in August.<br /> <br /> We missed the mark and are reviewing our image approval process to catch these instances before our books go to print. We are grateful to the World of Darkness community for contacting us about the illustration.\u200b </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-02T11:21:26-07:00","id":1510501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510500#post1510500\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The tweet and the preview are gone from the Renegade site. <a href=\"https://twitter.com/worldofdarkness/status/1653459362742927364\" target=\"_blank\">Outstar just posted a formal response</a><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for posting this!<br /> <br /> What's interesting is that this apology seems to indirectly confirm that there will be physical copies of W5 at GenCon. Seems like they caught it before it had gone to print.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-02T11:26:19-07:00","id":1510502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510501#post1510501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you for posting this!<br /> <br /> What's interesting is that this apology seems to indirectly confirm that there will be physical copies of W5 at GenCon. Seems like they caught it before it had gone to print.</div> </div> </div> </div>Technically if they're still in the sheet printing phase, they may be able to just substitute sheets. However once it all gets cut and blocked for binding, then you end up in problems.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-02T11:48:38-07:00","id":1510505,"title":"","content":"I genuinely hope this will make them actually audit the art better and hire better artists. Because as is shown in the twitter thread, copying directly from an image (NOT using it as a reference) seems to be a genuine issue with WoD's artists. Hence why the art has looked so stiff and uninspired as of late, this is just the one time shit hit the fan HARD.<br /> <br /> This is especially silly since you can find artists who could do WoD-style art easily without taking the easy way out and copying from google images.<br /> <br /> I'm glad that the image is going to be removed, regardless.<br /> <br /> EDIT: To clarify, referencing is when you look at pictures to get an idea of how something looks and works. Copying is when you copy the picture as is. If the artist had referenced a picture of T\u0101me Wairere, the final result would a looked similar, but not so that you can tell who it was based on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":110,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","user":"Ana Mizuki","date":". 05-02-2023, 02:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-02T16:43:26-07:00","id":1510529,"title":"","content":"This apology ticks the boxes it needs to tick, but still managed to be a veiled advertisement for the game, which I'm not a fan of. I hope their reviewing of the processes is legitimate and not just lip service. I'm also pleased they didn't just throw the artist under the bus but owned their mistake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-03T07:13:04-07:00","id":1510591,"title":"","content":"I'm just still puzzled by the use of tribal tattoos for one of the tribes least likely to use them. If the GW are gonna do tattoos, I expect something cyberpunk or pages from their favourite manga or something zanny or white-girl-rebellion or something. Tattoo a giant cockroach somewhere. <br /> <br /> Also like GW are rich and privileged types so it's weird to see an ethnic minority so commonly trapped in a poverty cycle.<br /> <br /> <br /> Postmodernism might be liberal but it doesn't mean you can do whatever the fuck you want and get away with it. There are still rules. But also how is a tribe supposed to have any sort of tribal identity if the writers are going out of their way to make them diverse?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-03T07:55:49-07:00","id":1510597,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510591#post1510591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm just still puzzled by the use of tribal tattoos for one of the tribes least likely to use them. If the GW are gonna do tattoos, I expect something cyberpunk or pages from their favourite manga or something zanny or white-girl-rebellion or something. Tattoo a giant cockroach somewhere.<br /> <br /> Also like GW are rich and privileged types so it's weird to see an ethnic minority so commonly trapped in a poverty cycle.<br /> <br /> <br /> Postmodernism might be liberal but it doesn't mean you can do whatever the fuck you want and get away with it. There are still rules. But also how is a tribe supposed to have any sort of tribal identity if the writers are going out of their way to make them diverse?</div> </div> </div> </div>One thing I've been thinking about is how the previews talked about Black Furies being the Tribe about fighting injustice and so that begs the question what is the thing Glass Walkers are defined by... And I think where it gets summarized is in the section for the Spider Patron Spirit where it talks about &quot;the Glass Walkers' drive to make things of lasting duration and effectiveness&quot;. That and the verbs is the Tribe now, I think. They're builders and techies now. And instead of going for any specific philosophy or aesthetic like cyberpunk, it's just this very broad idea of creating stuff that lasts and tech-stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-03T08:06:16-07:00","id":1510599,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510597#post1510597\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> One thing I've been thinking about is how the previews talked about Black Furies being the Tribe about fighting injustice and so that begs the question what is the thing Glass Walkers are defined by... And I think where it gets summarized is in the section for the Spider Patron Spirit where it talks about &quot;the Glass Walkers' drive to make things of lasting duration and effectiveness&quot;. That and the verbs is the Tribe now, I think. They're builders and techies now. And instead of going for any specific philosophy or aesthetic like cyberpunk, it's just this very broad idea of creating stuff that lasts and tech-stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>As somebody with a giant piece of Glass Walker tribebook art on the wall, I'm incredibly saddened.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-03T08:46:06-07:00","id":1510603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510529#post1510529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This apology ticks the boxes it needs to tick, but still managed to be a veiled advertisement for the game, which I'm not a fan of. I hope their reviewing of the processes is legitimate and not just lip service. I'm also pleased they didn't just throw the artist under the bus but owned their mistake.</div> </div> </div> </div>This isn't the first time even within this edition that a core book had a problem with a review process missed something. Of course it's just my cynical nature but, there is always hope that they really will look at their internal process and maybe get more oversight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12895-mrnatas","name":"MrNatas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12895_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"180"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-03T09:48:54-07:00","id":1510614,"title":"","content":"<img width=\"1280\" height=\"819\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nSzN3O8.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/nSzN3O8.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/nSzN3O8.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> New version is here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-03T10:20:11-07:00","id":1510618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510599#post1510599\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As somebody with a giant piece of Glass Walker tribebook art on the wall, I'm incredibly saddened.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm really wondering what it will be like reading all the Tribe-descriptions from beginning to end. Because the vibe I'm getting is similar to the H5 Creeds where I just feel like that considering its place in the setting there should be more to this. I'm also wondering how new players will react to this. Because when somebody introduced me to the VtM-Clans for the first time, the amount of lore and detail for each Clan was overwhelming - but it was also very intriguing. With this new presentation, it certainly got that &quot;Power-Point-presentation&quot;-vibe of cleanly summarizing it all with a couple bullet-points but you get the gist pretty fast and it doesn't feel like there's anything more to learn about this Tribe. Maybe the Gifts will salvage this somewhat... We'll see, I guess...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-03T10:39:49-07:00","id":1510619,"title":"","content":"<br /> Are bone Gnawers still a thing or did the glass walkers take enough of their stuff that they're no longer necessary?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-03T10:51:08-07:00","id":1510620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510619#post1510619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are bone Gnawers still a thing or did the glass walkers take enough of their stuff that they're no longer necessary?</div> </div> </div> </div>They are still a thing. We got a list of the tribes for W5.<br /> <br /> <img width=\"576\" height=\"1024\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://s3-eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/pdx-campaign-wp-data/uploads/sites/10/2023/04/21120634/image-2-576x1024.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://s3-eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/pdx-campaign-wp-data/uploads/sites/10/2023/04/21120634/image-2-576x1024.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://s3-eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/pdx-campaign-wp-data/uploads/sites/10/2023/04/21120634/image-2-576x1024.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-03T10:59:30-07:00","id":1510621,"title":"","content":"So, something I should've done way sooner... <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar110_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"110\" data-vbnamecard=\"110\">Ana Mizuki</a> had posted the <a href=\"https://imgur.com/GzZdoyZ\" target=\"_blank\">Retaliation Tribe-Cards</a> before. If you look at the Glass Walker card, it's like 99% identical to the first paragraph of the write-up from the preview (added some examples to the verbs and some minor adjustments here and there). So this kinda confirms that the write-ups from these cards are the basis for the Tribe-write-ups (at least as far as the very beginning of the write-up is concerned).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-08T18:45:30-07:00","id":1511094,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510114#post1510114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Do you want a cookie? What they told you doesnt mean shit. What have they told the community as a whole? Hell, what have they told the victim?</div> </div> </div> </div><b><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\">Better late than never. Leave the thread please.</span></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T01:44:35-07:00","id":1511199,"title":"","content":"<img title=\"image.png\" data-tempid=\"temp_1235_1683708245918_291\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1235\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1235\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1235&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"image.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> \u200b<br /> A friend sent me this - pretty disappointing to hear. (imgur link if you can't see: <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/a1LGuuG\" target=\"_blank\">https://imgur.com/a/a1LGuuG</a> )<br /> <br /> &quot;and only want enough of a surface brushing of inclusion so as to not be accused of being Eurocentric&quot;<br /> &quot;my ideas (...) were met with resistance, hostility and flat racism until the day the Hunters team were fired&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11620,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","user":"twig","date":". 05-10-2023, 05:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T02:03:55-07:00","id":1511200,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1511199#post1511199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A friend sent me this - pretty disappointing to hear.<br /> <br /> &quot;and only want enough of a surface brushing of inclusion so as to not be accused of being Eurocentric&quot;<br /> &quot;my ideas (...) were met with resistance, hostility and flat racism until the day the Hunters team were fired&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>The image can't be seen <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> .<br /> But with &quot;Hunters-team&quot; I assume this is about the Hunters Entertainment developer team that was working on the first version of W5?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T02:17:45-07:00","id":1511201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/a1LGuuG\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/a1LGuuG\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/a1LGuuG\" target=\"_blank\"> https://imgur.com/a/a1LGuuG </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Here ya go","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T02:34:28-07:00","id":1511202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1511201#post1511201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/a1LGuuG\" target=\"_blank\">https://imgur.com/a/a1LGuuG</a><br /> <br /> Here ya go</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> .<br /> <br /> It's troubling that what he describes echoes the experience that Alessa Torres described as Latin American Community Ambassador. That was around the whole controversy with the Second Inquisition supplement and how she felt the WOD-team didn't take the issue and the community's response to it seriously. What was worse in that instance was that they hid the apology on Discord-server for the Latin American WOD-community and never shared it anywhere else. At least this time around there was a more public apology.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T03:20:04-07:00","id":1511204,"title":"","content":"I kind of expected this, but it is not a good thing. I do wonder how the anti-indigenous philosophy expresses itself, especially in Werewolf. It would be good to know that so we could avoid repeating these mistakes.<br /> <br /> But it is not the first consultant hired to help in media that gets their suggestions ignored, which defeats the purpose of the consultant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T03:39:15-07:00","id":1511206,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1511204#post1511204\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I kind of expected this, but it is not a good thing. I do wonder how the anti-indigenous philosophy expresses itself, especially in Werewolf. It would be good to know that so we could avoid repeating these mistakes.<br /> <br /> But it is not the first consultant hired to help in media that gets their suggestions ignored, which defeats the purpose of the consultant.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think one thing that was mentioned in the Morgan Davie article that I also agree with is that it's better to be deliberate. It would've been better, for example, to take the chance of a rewrite with the Native American Tribes to bring on Native American writers, do research and talk to experts. Instead, the move was to sever any connections between human ethnicity/culture and the Tribes. But indigenous people are still talked about in W5 (from what we've seen in the previews). It's just that the ties between indigenous people and Garou are just this murky, vague thing. So any representation of indigenous people and culture is now equally vague and superficial. In the introduction from the previews, it says at one point: &quot;They learn to disregard the well-paid PR flacks justifying the unjustifiable and to listen to those voices speaking about Gaia with the same urgency the Garou themselves feel, whether it comes from scientists, activists, or indigenous people.\u200b&quot; So I guess, we'll see if any example-NPCs are mentioned that belong to indigenous groups and how much care has gone into the portrayal of them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T04:41:13-07:00","id":1511210,"title":"","content":"Well it's nice for confirmation but he's stating the fucking obvious. V5 and post-paradox 20th was chock-full of surface-deep egregious virtue signalling while minimizing the transgressive umph that made the series so compelling and genuinely progressive. World of Darkness? More like the world of sunshine and rainbows where real world issues are solved or ignored.<br /> <br /> Weirdly, werewolf kinda can get away with northern-hemisphere centric attitudes, because they've limited themselves to one type of wolf that exclusively lives in the northern hemisphere, except for the weird moments where they've gone out on a limb and ritually transformed themselves into something else. Now personally I'm an advocate for a broader werewolf definition and would happily accept a selection of other canids, but there's still a limit to how inclusive you could be with that . I'm only using it because it's such a great example, but there's nothing wrong with a lack of Maori werewolves, it'd be weird to force Maori inclusion given that new zealand has never had wild canids nor an equivalent (The Maori had domestic dogs, but Garou don't do that)<br /> <br /> No inclusion is better than bad inclusion. Tokenism is bad. It's nice for marketing, but a deeper look and you'll realize how empty and hollow it all is. There's nothing wrong with sticking with what you know, and one of the nice things about the WoD is that knowledge about supernaturals is all hidden or covered in misinformation so it's perfectly fine that some glass walker has never heard of the Hakken.<br /> <br /> I would rather see a Ugandan write about his region with confidence and depth to the exclusion of areas and ethnicities he doesn't know about than to see him try and accommodate Brazilians by writing about a France he knows little about. That's what this forced diversity feels like, it's for ignorant white liberals, not the people they're actually including. A Ugandan isn't going to jump with joy when you start being inclusive and using Angola, and few appreciate being a footnote when you try to include everyone. <br /> <br /> Going the other route and acting like mortal cultures don't matter is really fucking weird for a game about tribes and tribalism.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 05-10-2023, 07:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T10:12:31-07:00","id":1511237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1511204#post1511204\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I kind of expected this, but it is not a good thing. I do wonder how the anti-indigenous philosophy expresses itself, especially in Werewolf. It would be good to know that so we could avoid repeating these mistakes.<br /> <br /> But it is not the first consultant hired to help in media that gets their suggestions ignored, which defeats the purpose of the consultant.</div> </div> </div> </div>It only defeats the purpose of the consultant if they're hired in good faith.<br /> <br /> A consultant being hired could serve two purposes; you want their advice, or you want to be seen to have listened to someone like the consultant.<br /> <br /> For PR, the latter is more important... most of the time. Until someone calls you out. Then you've bought yourself a lot of bad publicity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T10:18:19-07:00","id":1511238,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1511210#post1511210\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well it's nice for confirmation but he's stating the fucking obvious. V5 and post-paradox 20th was chock-full of surface-deep egregious virtue signalling while minimizing the transgressive umph that made the series so compelling and genuinely progressive. World of Darkness? More like the world of sunshine and rainbows where real world issues are solved or ignored.<br /> <br /> Weirdly, werewolf kinda can get away with northern-hemisphere centric attitudes, because they've limited themselves to one type of wolf that exclusively lives in the northern hemisphere, except for the weird moments where they've gone out on a limb and ritually transformed themselves into something else. Now personally I'm an advocate for a broader werewolf definition and would happily accept a selection of other canids, but there's still a limit to how inclusive you could be with that . I'm only using it because it's such a great example, but there's nothing wrong with a lack of Maori werewolves, it'd be weird to force Maori inclusion given that new zealand has never had wild canids nor an equivalent (The Maori had domestic dogs, but Garou don't do that)<br /> <br /> No inclusion is better than bad inclusion. Tokenism is bad. It's nice for marketing, but a deeper look and you'll realize how empty and hollow it all is. There's nothing wrong with sticking with what you know, and one of the nice things about the WoD is that knowledge about supernaturals is all hidden or covered in misinformation so it's perfectly fine that some glass walker has never heard of the Hakken.<br /> <br /> I would rather see a Ugandan write about his region with confidence and depth to the exclusion of areas and ethnicities he doesn't know about than to see him try and accommodate Brazilians by writing about a France he knows little about. That's what this forced diversity feels like, it's for ignorant white liberals, not the people they're actually including. A Ugandan isn't going to jump with joy when you start being inclusive and using Angola, and few appreciate being a footnote when you try to include everyone.<br /> <br /> Going the other route and acting like mortal cultures don't matter is really fucking weird for a game about tribes and tribalism.</div> </div> </div> </div>The term virtue signaling is often misused, and I consider it a red flag, but despite that this REALLY nails it. It is all about signaling that they're very progressive and have #listened to #native voices, but none of it goes any further than skin deep (ironically). If they'd really doubled down on Native American stuff, really focused on the USA, they could have had something good. Left other parts of the world to supplementary books, and given people tools to work in their own cultures.<br /> <br /> C20, for instance (the corebook specifically) gave players the tools to include some folklore from their own culture, instead of trying to make every possible indigenous myth. It then undoes that work later in the book with some of the Gallain, but the core concept is worthy of emulation. We have told you our story, the story of a supernatural USA, with some global overarching info and given you tools to tell a story anywhere in the world. Maybe seeing a well written account of blending IRL Native American stuff with these two particular Garou Tribes will inspire you, someone from a native Australian / NZ background, to write your own cool stuff for your campaign!<br /> <br /> So the solve would've literally been to go specific, narrow their vision, and focus on what they know, and hire a handful of experts for the stuff they don't within that limited vision.<br /> <br /> Instead they hired people whose job is to focus on the cultural and diversity stuff and then ignore them. And that is real, genuine actual virtue signaling, as in the original definition of the term, before it was co-opted to mean &quot;a person did any kind of activism at all&quot; basically.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T10:46:51-07:00","id":1511240,"title":"","content":"Just echoing the statements of <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11620_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11620\" data-vbnamecard=\"11620\">twig</a> s and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25794_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25794\" data-vbnamecard=\"25794\">MyWifeIsScary</a>. I personally am not really that shocked that allegations like this have come out. When you read some of the stuff that was printed it feels like a checkbox that was going down the list rather then any genuine feelings about that subject. I said this before (not sure if it was this thread or another) but, it feels more like stuff printed is them wanting to present themselves a certain way then actually being that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12895-mrnatas","name":"MrNatas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12895_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"180"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-21T02:57:35-07:00","id":1512267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1509727-glass-walkers-have-won-the-poll-for-a-preview?p=1510349#post1510349\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean the artist's mindset is pretty clear. The artist was lazy, got on Google, typed in &quot;Maori Tattoos&quot; and then largely copied one of the pictures that popped up.</div> </div> </div> </div><b><span style=\"color:#c0392b\">This is not a forum to be making these kinds of statements. Leave the thread and take a warning.</span></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysterie